 "c": [
  {"i":2274,"t":["thinking"],"s":{"2":["food"]},"n":"Entrusting a decision (お任せします) is about choosing and deciding. The chef's-choice meal is a separate food sense."},
  {"i":2285,"t":["shopping","business"],"s":{},"n":"Goods are taught in shopping. 商品 is also core business vocabulary (商品開発, 新商品)."},
  {"i":2297,"t":["communication","work"],"s":{},"n":"Learners mostly meet it in phone and message phrases (ご用件は何でしょうか), so communication comes first."},
  {"i":2302,"t":["actions"],"s":{"2":["technology"]},"n":"The main sense is general sharing. File and social-media sharing is the technology sense."},
  {"i":2326,"t":["people","society"],"s":{},"n":"Mankind belongs with people and with society and history. The link to science is loose."},
  {"i":2336,"t":["feelings"],"s":{"2":["function"]},"n":"気味が悪い is a feeling. The tendency sense is the N3 grammar suffix -気味 (風邪気味)."},
  {"i":2341,"t":["travel","geography"],"s":{},"n":"It is taught mainly through 海外旅行 in the travel unit. Geography is secondary."},
  {"i":2348,"t":["technology"],"s":{"4":["relationships"]},"n":"Following on social media is technology. Relationships fits only the support sense (covering for someone), so it belongs in the sense entry, not in t."},
  {"i":2391,"t":["thinking","health"],"s":{},"n":"Sanity and soberness are first a matter of the mind. Health is secondary."},
  {"i":2392,"t":["numbers"],"s":{},"n":"号 is a numbering suffix (3号車, 5月号), not a true counter. Numbers alone is enough."}
